{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/ae54c92ecaa803457b9610a7535080fc.avif?t=1768313212\" width=1280 height=362 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit Historical Figures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your time machine to bring iconic characters from history into battle. Each character has unique perks, and stacking the right combinations creates devastating team synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/8d0db1e56e811bafa8d07d5d0600eabe.poster.avif?t=1768313212\" width=744 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/8d0db1e56e811bafa8d07d5d0600eabe.webm?t=1768313212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/8d0db1e56e811bafa8d07d5d0600eabe.mp4?t=1768313212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Auto-Battler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your strategy, position your heroes, and watch spectacular chaotic battles unfold automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/f0011184034619a062faa0729b9aaa0b.poster.avif?t=1768313212\" width=836 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/f0011184034619a062faa0729b9aaa0b.webm?t=1768313212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/f0011184034619a062faa0729b9aaa0b.mp4?t=1768313212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear Up Your Squad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit shops along your journey to buy upgrades and equip your heroes with gear that shapes their power and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/c70b34fc6fa086f519716203d4c1f586.poster.avif?t=1768313212\" width=522 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/c70b34fc6fa086f519716203d4c1f586.webm?t=1768313212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/c70b34fc6fa086f519716203d4c1f586.mp4?t=1768313212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to two friends and outsmart your foes together. Trade equipment, optimize each other\u2019s builds, and unleash devastating tactical combos against escalating threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/aa67f48c3124ef0bee7f8d5c9aac8885.poster.avif?t=1768313212\" width=664 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/aa67f48c3124ef0bee7f8d5c9aac8885.webm?t=1768313212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/aa67f48c3124ef0bee7f8d5c9aac8885.mp4?t=1768313212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Traveling Voyage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through time, visiting Ancient Egypt, the Italian Renaissance, and other extraordinary places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/5b7cdfc3ba1539b802ed7f80d2f83ded.poster.avif?t=1768313212\" width=522 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/5b7cdfc3ba1539b802ed7f80d2f83ded.webm?t=1768313212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/5b7cdfc3ba1539b802ed7f80d2f83ded.mp4?t=1768313212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your HQ</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each mission, upgrade your headquarters to expand your roster, develop cutting-edge gadgets, and enhance your team\u2019s capabilities for the next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/0c023ac260b48f736b14a9bbd7581c93.poster.avif?t=1768313212\" width=720 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/0c023ac260b48f736b14a9bbd7581c93.webm?t=1768313212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/0c023ac260b48f736b14a9bbd7581c93.mp4?t=1768313212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the ultimate showdown: a final battle to save humanity from monstrous invaders in this epic last stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/5445d283d86ac679d